.TH CAMERA_RECT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
camera_rect \- Convert a world\-space rectangle to screen space, scaling its size by zoom
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqcamera.h\(dq
.BI "Rect camera_rect(const Camera *c, Rect world);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Convert a world\-space rectangle to screen space, scaling its size by zoom. Use to draw hitboxes or world\-space panels with draw_rect.
.SH RETURN VALUE
the Rect in logical pixels.
.SH MODULE
camera (src/engine/camera/camera.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR camera_to_screen (3),
.BR draw_rect (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
